### 4.2 Reed-Solomon Code RS(15,11)

We employ a Reed-Solomon code with the following parameters:

```
Field:              𝔽₁₆
Block length:       n = 15 symbols  (60 bits)
Message length:     k = 11 symbols  (44 bits)
Parity symbols:     n − k = 4       (16 bits)
Error correction:   t = 2 symbols   (8 bits) per block
